Regression tests for native glibc loader-cache resolution.

Apply after nono-0.80.0-resolve-loader-libraries.patch. Cover non-default
locations, exact SONAME lookup, versioned filenames, excluded hwcaps entries,
ordered same-ABI alternatives, ABI-sensitive memoization, malformed caches,
stale entries, per-pass reset and fail-closed errors. Preserve existing
interpreter-directory precedence regressions with the new resolver argument.

